<TXT>Design conditions must be as specified in Section <SRF>33 52 43.11</SRF> AVIATION FUEL MECHANICAL EQUIPMENT.  Submit <SUB>Operation 
and Maintenance Manuals</SUB> for the equipment items or systems listed below.  Refer to Section <SRF>01 78 23.33</SRF> OPERATION 
AND MAINTENANCE MANUALS FOR AVIATION FUEL SYSTEMS for the information to be submitted for various type of equipment 
and systems.</TXT><BRK/>
