         <CEL MERGEACROSS="1">
<DTA TYPE="STRING">Note:  Make allowance for the<MET>1 mm</MET><ENG> 1/32-inch</ENG> thickness of the insulating sleeve around the bolts when sizing the mounting lugs.</DTA>
         </CEL>
